{
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LESHY_ANCIENT.epithet": "野兽占卜师",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LESHY_ANCIENT.talk.ANY.0-0r.ancient": "欢迎回来。要不要来一局？",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LESHY_ANCIENT.talk.ANY.1-0r.ancient": "啊，你回来了。我正在泡茶，如果你愿意的话，可以喝一杯。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LESHY_ANCIENT.talk.ANY.2-0r.ancient": "你回来了，爬塔人。牌已经洗好了，如果你有时间的话，不妨来一局。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LESHY_ANCIENT.talk.ANY.3-0r.ancient": "哦，我今天还没准备好。我还在制作下一张地图。请务必尽快回来。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LESHY_ANCIENT.talk.DEFECT.0-0r.ancient": "你是他创造的其中一个吗？",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LESHY_ANCIENT.talk.DEFECT.0-0r.next": "回复",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LESHY_ANCIENT.talk.DEFECT.0-1r.char": "[i][font_size=22]<困惑的哔哔声>[/font_size][/i]",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LESHY_ANCIENT.talk.DEFECT.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LESHY_ANCIENT.talk.DEFECT.0-2r.ancient": "嗯……不，太客气了。请拿一件遗物，继续你的攀登吧。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LESHY_ANCIENT.talk.IRONCLAD.0-0r.ancient": "士兵，收起你的剑吧。来杯热饮怎么样？",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LESHY_ANCIENT.talk.IRONCLAD.0-0r.next": "继续",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LESHY_ANCIENT.talk.IRONCLAD.0-1r.char": "[i][font_size=22]铁甲战士鞠了一躬，坐了下来。[/font_size][/i]",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LESHY_ANCIENT.talk.NECROBINDER.0-0r.ancient": "晚上好。要不要玩个游戏？",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LESHY_ANCIENT.talk.NECROBINDER.0-0r.next": "谈话",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LESHY_ANCIENT.talk.NECROBINDER.0-1r.char": "对不起，我现在没时间。下次再聊吧？",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LESHY_ANCIENT.talk.NECROBINDER.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LESHY_ANCIENT.talk.NECROBINDER.0-2r.ancient": "没关系。我可以等。我时间多的是。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LESHY_ANCIENT.talk.REGENT.0-0r.char": "森林之古者，我前来寻求您的祝福！",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LESHY_ANCIENT.talk.REGENT.0-0r.next": "继续",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LESHY_ANCIENT.talk.REGENT.0-1r.ancient": "当然，陛下。不过在您离开之前，能否赏脸与我打上一局牌呢？",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LESHY_ANCIENT.talk.REGENT.0-1r.next": "回复",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LESHY_ANCIENT.talk.REGENT.0-2r.char": "如果这就是你想要的，那就照你说的办吧！不过请快点，我还有要紧事要处理。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LESHY_ANCIENT.talk.SILENT.0-0r.ancient": "[i][font_size=22]莱希仔细打量着静默猎手，朝那把空着的椅子示意。[/font_size][/i]",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LESHY_ANCIENT.talk.SILENT.0-0r.next": "继续",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LESHY_ANCIENT.talk.SILENT.0-1r.char": "[i][font_size=22]静默猎手坐在那里，和他们一起玩游戏。[/font_size][/i]",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LESHY_ANCIENT.talk.firstVisitEver.0-0.ancient": "欢迎。请坐。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LESHY_ANCIENT.talk.firstVisitEver.0-0.next": "继续",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LESHY_ANCIENT.talk.firstVisitEver.0-1.ancient": "欢迎你拿走我的一件遗物，不过在此之前，要不要先玩一局纸牌？",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LESHY_ANCIENT.title": "莱希",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LUNATIC_CULTIST_ANCIENT.epithet": "星界贤者",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LUNATIC_CULTIST_ANCIENT.talk.ANY.0-0r.ancient": "离开这座神庙。我的修行绝不能被打断。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LUNATIC_CULTIST_ANCIENT.talk.ANY.1-0r.ancient": "我正在举行仪式，异教徒。拿一件遗物，然后滚出去。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LUNATIC_CULTIST_ANCIENT.talk.ANY.2-0r.ancient": "[i][font_size=22]邪教徒甚至没有理会你来了。他的一个仆人将你引向一盘遗物。[/font_size][/i]",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LUNATIC_CULTIST_ANCIENT.talk.ANY.3-0r.ancient": "[i][font_size=22]发现你来了，邪教徒叹了口气，朝一堆遗物示意。[/font_size][/i]",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LUNATIC_CULTIST_ANCIENT.talk.DEFECT.0-0r.ancient": "机械构造体，此地不欢迎你的出现。你究竟为何要玷污这些大厅？",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LUNATIC_CULTIST_ANCIENT.talk.DEFECT.0-0r.next": "回复",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LUNATIC_CULTIST_ANCIENT.talk.DEFECT.0-1r.char": "[i][font_size=22]<愤怒的蜂鸣声>[/font_size][/i]",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LUNATIC_CULTIST_ANCIENT.talk.DEFECT.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LUNATIC_CULTIST_ANCIENT.talk.DEFECT.0-2r.ancient": "修好你？修好你的朋友？可笑至极。我本不该考虑这种事，但我还是会把力量赐予你。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LUNATIC_CULTIST_ANCIENT.talk.IRONCLAD.0-0r.ancient": "战士，像你这样的人在这座神庙里可不受欢迎。请说明来意，否则请离开。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LUNATIC_CULTIST_ANCIENT.talk.IRONCLAD.0-0r.next": "继续",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LUNATIC_CULTIST_ANCIENT.talk.IRONCLAD.0-1r.char": "[i][font_size=22]铁甲战士用剑指向天空。[/font_size][/i]",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LUNATIC_CULTIST_ANCIENT.talk.IRONCLAD.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LUNATIC_CULTIST_ANCIENT.talk.IRONCLAD.0-2r.ancient": "杀死建筑师？不太可能，但我还是会把这件遗物送给你。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LUNATIC_CULTIST_ANCIENT.talk.NECROBINDER.0-0r.ancient": "亡灵契约师，我正忙着。立刻离开这里。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LUNATIC_CULTIST_ANCIENT.talk.NECROBINDER.0-0r.next": "回复",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LUNATIC_CULTIST_ANCIENT.talk.NECROBINDER.0-1r.char": "我不能那样做。我必须继续向上走。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LUNATIC_CULTIST_ANCIENT.talk.NECROBINDER.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LUNATIC_CULTIST_ANCIENT.talk.NECROBINDER.0-2r.ancient": "好吧，既然这样。如果这样能让你离开，那就拿走一件遗物吧。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LUNATIC_CULTIST_ANCIENT.talk.REGENT.0-0r.char": "伟大的法师，我来取一件遗物！",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LUNATIC_CULTIST_ANCIENT.talk.REGENT.0-0r.next": "继续",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LUNATIC_CULTIST_ANCIENT.talk.REGENT.0-1r.ancient": "你打扰我学习了。立刻滚出去。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LUNATIC_CULTIST_ANCIENT.talk.REGENT.0-1r.next": "请求",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LUNATIC_CULTIST_ANCIENT.talk.REGENT.0-2r.char": "没有我的恩赐，异教徒，休想！",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LUNATIC_CULTIST_ANCIENT.talk.REGENT.0-2r.next": "继续",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LUNATIC_CULTIST_ANCIENT.talk.REGENT.0-3r.ancient": "往左看。快拿点东西，然后自己走开，在我失去耐心之前。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LUNATIC_CULTIST_ANCIENT.talk.SILENT.0-0r.ancient": "你这邪恶之徒，究竟为何闯入我的神殿？",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LUNATIC_CULTIST_ANCIENT.talk.SILENT.0-0r.next": "继续",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LUNATIC_CULTIST_ANCIENT.talk.SILENT.0-1r.char": "[i][font_size=22]静默猎手低下了头，递出一捆仪式用羊皮纸。[/font_size][/i]",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LUNATIC_CULTIST_ANCIENT.talk.SILENT.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LUNATIC_CULTIST_ANCIENT.talk.SILENT.0-2r.ancient": "……挺周到。说不定你会因此获得一份祝福。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LUNATIC_CULTIST_ANCIENT.talk.firstVisitEver.0-0.ancient": "你打扰我学习了。拿个护身符，然后赶紧滚开。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-LUNATIC_CULTIST_ANCIENT.title": "疯狂教徒",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.epithet": "无为之主",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.ANY.0-0r.ancient": "你回来了？真恶心。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.ANY.1-0r.ancient": "我们又见面了。带着我的祝福走吧，害虫。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.ANY.2-0r.ancient": "你真是不知疲倦。这改变不了任何事。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.ANY.3-0r.ancient": "啊，又来了一个讨厌鬼，想来抢宝藏了。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.ANY.4-0r.ancient": "收下这个吧，害虫，接纳设计吧。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.ANY.5-0r.ancient": "又是只害虫？拿个小玩意儿，赶紧走人吧。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.ANY.6-0r.ancient": "你的意志终将崩溃。在那之前，收下这份恩赐吧，害虫。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.ANY.7-0r.ancient": "看来你仍在不遗余力地战斗。或许我干脆亲手了结你算了。这倒是一种仁慈。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.DEFECT.0-0r.ancient": "一个构造体？源自灵魂……真恶心。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.DEFECT.0-0r.next": "回复",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.DEFECT.0-1r.char": "[i][font_size=22]<愤怒的蜂鸣声>[/font_size][/i]",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.DEFECT.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.DEFECT.0-2r.ancient": "收下你的恩赐，然后滚出去，你这混蛋。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.DEFECT.1-0r.ancient": "构造体，是谁造出你的？",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.DEFECT.1-0r.next": "回复",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.DEFECT.1-1r.char": "[i][font_size=22]<不高兴的蜂鸣声>[/font_size][/i]",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.DEFECT.1-1r.next": "继续",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.DEFECT.1-2r.ancient": "建筑师？我明白了。所以这就是你和他们之间的事。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.DEFECT.1-2r.next": "回复",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.DEFECT.1-3r.char": "[i][font_size=22]<肯定的嘟嘟声>[/font_size][/i]",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.DEFECT.1-3r.next": "继续",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.DEFECT.1-4r.ancient": "也许并非所有有灵魂的构造体都像守护者那样邪恶。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.IRONCLAD.0-0r.ancient": "欢迎，来自地狱的害虫。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.IRONCLAD.0-0r.next": "继续",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.IRONCLAD.0-1r.char": "[i][font_size=22]铁甲战士挥舞着他的大刀。[/font_size][/i]",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.IRONCLAD.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.IRONCLAD.0-2r.ancient": "别再挣扎了，接受这份恩惠吧，可怜虫。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.IRONCLAD.1-0r.ancient": "害虫，你为什么还要执着于这次任务？",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.IRONCLAD.1-0r.next": "继续",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.IRONCLAD.1-1r.char": "[i][font_size=22]铁甲战士将剑指向天空。[/font_size][/i]",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.IRONCLAD.1-1r.next": "继续",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.IRONCLAD.1-2r.ancient": "杀死建筑师？愚蠢。你让我想起了我的哥哥。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.NECROBINDER.0-0r.ancient": "鲜血与灵魂在你体内流淌。你到底做了什么，咒术师？",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.NECROBINDER.0-0r.next": "回复",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.NECROBINDER.0-1r.char": "我做什么与你无关。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.NECROBINDER.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.NECROBINDER.0-2r.ancient": "那就这样吧。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.NECROBINDER.1-0r.ancient": "咒术师，你前进是为了什么？",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.NECROBINDER.1-0r.next": "谈话",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.NECROBINDER.1-1r.char": "为我的家人报仇。他必须为自己所做的一切付出代价。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.NECROBINDER.1-1r.next": "继续",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.NECROBINDER.1-2r.ancient": "不要为这段充满回忆的旅程感到遗憾。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.REGENT.0-0r.ancient": "不过是一只害虫，却穿得如此古怪。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.REGENT.0-0r.next": "训斥",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.REGENT.0-1r.char": "害虫！？你竟敢冒犯星之王座的继承人！",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.REGENT.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.REGENT.0-2r.ancient": "害虫不配坐上王位。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.REGENT.0-2r.next": "谈话",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.REGENT.0-3r.char": "我本该当场将你杀死，但我会网开一面！只要你送我一份礼物，我就走人！",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.REGENT.0-3r.next": "继续",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.REGENT.0-4r.ancient": "如果这样能让你闭嘴，那就赶紧拿吧。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.REGENT.1-0r.ancient": "害虫之王又来了。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.REGENT.1-0r.next": "回复",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.REGENT.1-1r.char": "狂妄的蠢货！你知道我是谁吗？",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.REGENT.1-1r.next": "继续",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.REGENT.1-2r.ancient": "一个不知天高地厚的无知蝼蚁。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.REGENT.1-2r.next": "挑战",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.REGENT.1-3r.char": "如果我对你来说只是个讨厌鬼，那就来和我正面交锋吧！",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.REGENT.1-3r.next": "继续",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.REGENT.1-4r.ancient": "你这个害虫，不值得我浪费时间。拿件遗物赶紧滚。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.SILENT.0-0r.ancient": "又有个害虫要爬上尖塔了吗？",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.SILENT.0-0r.next": "沉默",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.SILENT.0-1r.char": "……",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.SILENT.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.SILENT.0-2r.ancient": "没有无礼之言？你比那些其他害虫好对付多了。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.SILENT.1-0r.ancient": "明明如此虚弱无力，你却依然坚持不放弃？",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.SILENT.1-0r.next": "沉默",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.SILENT.1-1r.char": "……",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.SILENT.1-1r.next": "继续",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.SILENT.1-2r.ancient": "拿走你的廉价饰品和小玩意儿吧，害虫。你很快就会粉身碎骨。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.talk.firstVisitEver.0-0.ancient": "你好啊，害虫。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-MITHRIX_ANCIENT.title": "米斯里克斯",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-SEBASTIAN_ANCIENT.epithet": "声名狼藉的勤杂工",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-SEBASTIAN_ANCIENT.talk.ANY.0-0r.ancient": "哟，嘿！快看，我刚才在巢穴里转了一圈，发现了不少好东西。我找到了你的尸体，你的一些遗物居然还完好无损！",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-SEBASTIAN_ANCIENT.talk.ANY.0-0r.next": "继续",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-SEBASTIAN_ANCIENT.talk.ANY.0-1r.ancient": "嘿，别担心，你可以把它们要回来……不过得付点钱哦~",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-SEBASTIAN_ANCIENT.talk.ANY.1-0r.ancient": "很高兴看到你还活蹦乱跳的。要不要来件古董？~",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-SEBASTIAN_ANCIENT.talk.ANY.2-0r.ancient": "啊，欢迎回来。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-SEBASTIAN_ANCIENT.talk.ANY.3-0r.ancient": "今天能长话短说吗？我马上要开会了。",
  "ANCIENTSAWAKENED-SEBASTIAN_ANCIENT.talk.ANY.4-0r.ancient": "再来一轮？行，那你选吧。",
